	(text "LM5164 per-driver buck (HVBUS -> VS), software-set by the DAC injecting current into FB:\nVS = 1.2V x (1 + 499k/15.2k + 499k/60.4k) - Vdac x 499k/60.4k = 24..50.5 V for Vdac = 3.2..0 V.\nfSW = VS x 2500 / RON (400-800 kHz). Type-3 ripple network Ra/Ca/Cb. The converter is DNP by default:\nfit EITHER this buck (all parts except the 0R link) OR the 0R link to HVBUS, never both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 152.4 0)
